  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "He stands outside the melee and manipulates the snakes with his mind. Two snakes can pincer an opponent while he keeps the control precise, at higher mental cost. Damage to the snakes can be healed by spending primeval essence. Fire pellet Gu pellets that fuse into the snakes make weakened snakes more vigorous again. That pairing is the combination battle tactic of fire pellet Gu and fiery snake Gu. Frost Breath Gu slows and restrains their offense, and can shrink a snake under a stronger frost breath.",
        "chapters": [
          313
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_fire_pellet_gu",
          "gu_frost_breath_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He recalls the snakes into his nose, then sends them out again. Restoring two snakes to peak size and power after heavy damage costs him twenty percent of his yellow gold primeval essence. When they land on fuel-soaked grassland they create blazing flames that turn the stage into a sea of fire.",
        "chapters": [
          314
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "combined-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Four Fiery Claw Gu merge into the two snakes. The snakes grow claws and become fiery dragons that display a portion of the might of rank five fiery dragon Gu. Audiences name that killer move fire sea twin dragon kill. The dragons attack Bai Ning Bing’s ice blade storm, recover in the sea of fire, then merge into one larger dragon. After her storm engulfs most of that dragon, Yan Tu loses a fiery snake Gu and two fiery claw Gu in an instant.",
        "chapters": [
          314
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "combined-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_fiery_claw_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
